  id: mist_hunter
  displayName: Mist Hunter
  description: Tier 1 Hunter. Stalks the Fungal Marshes by night. Fast, low HP, deadly
    if not tracked.
  tier: 1
  family: 2
  behaviors:
  - Stays mostly invisible, attacks from behind.
  - Retreats to recover stealth between strikes.
  - Can be tracked by faint footprint trail.
  - Vulnerable in the moment after an attack (1-2 second window).
  abilities:
  - "Pounce \u2014 sudden leap from stealth"
  - "Throat Tear \u2014 high damage close-range"
  - "Mist Veil \u2014 re-enters stealth, even mid-fight"
  - "Shriek \u2014 momentarily blinds player"
  dropItemIds:
  - Hunter's Pelt (Ranger Garb component)
  - Sharp Bone Tip x4
  - Predator Meat x2
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Hunter Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
